"type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T14:48:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T14:48:36Z","body":"I would like to take a look at this issue, i will post an update once I have a potential fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3773257554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775066144","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107606#issuecomment-3775066144","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107606","id":3775066144,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hAvAg","user":{"login":"tciviero","id":179772110,"node_id":"U_kgDOCrcazg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179772110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero","html_url":"https://github.com/tciviero","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tciviero/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-20T21:38:15Z","updated_at":"2026-01-20T21:47:56Z","body":"Even though the ScriptEditor::_add_callback happens first, it does not save the script if it is built-in, removing this condition makes both the binds and unbinds work with no issue.\n\nOnly the built-in script gets saved, so if you close the scene without saving when prompted, the connection does not get saved but the method still gets created and saved to disk.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/78c6632eb174aabb2790975cf83e28fee065b43d/editor/script/script_editor_plugin.cpp#L3017-L3025\n\nI do not know if this check was put in place because of a performance hit, if it is not the case, then this fixes the issue.\n\nI will not attempt to make a pull request yet, as i feel there is a better runtime solution that does not force a save to disk, but im not familiar yet with the engine so i need more time to research better solutions ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775066144/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3775103980","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107606#issuecomment-3775103980","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107606","id":3775103980,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7hA4Ps","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","event